    <briefdescription>
<para>YAML-loadable dictionary-based substitution rule. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Maps exact terms or phrases to canonical replacements. Thread-safe after construction. Supports case-sensitive or case-insensitive matching. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
